  "description": "*\"The beginning of every incident begins with stumbling upon a small trace left behind by someone. However, most small traces are fragments of something that is already broken.\"* \n\nAn ordinary repeat student, Jeong Si-Myeong. Strange incidents continue to occur around him, and as he digs into the truth, his memories become tangled and seem to be shrouded in fog. And all of these incidents point back to him... \n\n*\"If you didn't do it, then who did all this..?\"*\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
